  "title": "FIX: the noun Value shall be translated to the noun Valeur",
  "description": "The noun Value is translated into the noun Valeur. Evaluer is a verb (to value).\nI did not check whether Value is also used as a verb in the UI. Value is actually translated everywhere else as \"Valeur\", so I suppose this is not the case. If it is, it will have to be taken care of, I suppose, by providing two distinct translations in the file: one for the verb, the other for the noun.",
